// Every construct the language has, all of them satisfied.
package layered {
    root   src
    facade root.zig
}

zones {
    floor  floor.zig
    engine engine/**
    face   face.zig
}

seal engine through engine.zig
keep face.zig to root.zig

limit  reach to 2 hops
forbid cycles across directories

variance seal face.zig -> engine/parts.zig
    because
        \\The demo needs one spent variance, and a seal bypass is the only law
        \\this package can break without also tripping another. Retire it by
        \\re-exporting what `face.zig` wants from `engine.zig`.
